 \"seeded scope, observations, open questions, next steps.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: use manage_docs create_doc, keep content scoped to this sub-audit, no manual edits.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Need a dedicated audit record to analyze replace_section/apply_patch reliability before implementing safeguards.\\\"}\": \"\"}, \"project\": \"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2705] [2026-01-02 05:47:21 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Created focused audit doc for manage_docs replace_section/apply_patch hardening: AUDIT_MANAGE_DOCS_REPLACE_SECTION.md. reasoning: {\\\"why\\\":\\\"Need a dedicated audit record to analyze replace_section/apply_patch reliability before implementing safeguards.\\\",\\\"what\\\":\\\"Constraints: use manage_docs create_doc, keep content scoped to this sub-audit, no manual edits.\\\",\\\"how\\\":\\\"Used manage_docs create_doc with doc_name and target_dir; seeded scope, observations, open questions, next steps.\\\"}   component=manage_docs; doc=AUDIT_MANAGE_DOCS_REPLACE_SECTION.md; reasoning={\\\"how\\\": \\\"Used manage_docs create_doc with doc_name and target_dir; seeded scope, observations, open questions, next steps.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: use manage_docs create_doc, keep content scoped to this sub-audit, no manual edits.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Need a dedicated audit record to analyze replace_section/apply_patch reliability before implementing safeguards.\\\"}; log_type=progress\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-02 05:47:21 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"emoji\": \"\\u2705\", \"message\": \"Updated and registered audit doc with output readability requirements; re-created AUDIT_MANAGE_DOCS_REPLACE_SECTION.md using create_doc overwrite+register_doc so future edits can use apply_patch. reasoning: {\\\"why\\\":\\\"Audit scope expanded to include tool output readability and token-guarding; doc needed registry entry for ongoing edits.\\\",\\\"what\\\":\\\"Constraints: manage_docs only; create_d