entry for ongoing edits.\\\"}; log_type=progress\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-02 05:50:51 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"emoji\": \"\\u2705\", \"message\": \"Implemented auto-registration for create_doc: if metadata.register_doc is unset, docs created under docs_dir now register automatically with a warning; explicit register_doc=false still supported. reasoning: {\\\"why\\\":\\\"Reduce friction for doc edits and avoid DOC_NOT_FOUND on follow-up patches while preserving opt-out for scratch docs.\\\",\\\"what\\\":\\\"Constraints: keep registry explicit when needed; avoid registering out-of-scope paths; preserve existing error handling.\\\",\\\"how\\\":\\\"Updated tools/manage_docs.py create_doc registry flow to infer register_doc based on docs_dir and add a warning when defaulted.\\\"}\", \"meta\": {\"avoid registering out-of-scope paths\": \"\", \"component\": \"manage_docs\", \"files\": \"[\\\"tools/manage_docs.py\\\"]\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"preserve existing error handling.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Reduce friction for doc edits and avoid DOC_NOT_FOUND on follow-up patches while preserving opt-out for scratch docs.\\\"}\": \"\", \"reasoning\": \"{\\\"how\\\": \\\"Updated tools/manage_docs.py create_doc registry flow to infer register_doc based on docs_dir and add a warning when defaulted.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: keep registry explicit when needed\"}, \"project\": \"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2705] [2026-01-02 06:04:57 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Implemented auto-registration for create_doc: if metadata.register_doc is unset, docs created under docs_dir now register automatically with a warning; explicit register_doc=false still supported. reasoning: {\\\"why\\\":\\\"Reduce friction for doc edits and avoid DOC_NOT_FOUND on follow-up patches while preserving opt-out for scratch docs.\\\",\\\"what\\\":\\\"Constraints: keep registry explicit when needed; avoid registering out-of-scope paths; preserve existing error handling.\\\",\\\"how\\\":\\\"Updated tools/manage_docs.py create_doc registry flow to infer register_doc based on docs_dir and add a warning when defaulted.\\\"}   component=manage_docs; files=[\\\"tools/manage_docs.py\\\"]; reasoning={\\\"how\\\": \\\"Updated tools/manage_docs.py create_doc registry flow to infer register_doc based on docs_dir and add a warning when defaulted.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: keep registry explicit when needed; avoid registering out-of-scope paths; preserve existing error handling.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Reduce friction for doc edits and avoid DOC_NOT_FOUND on follow-up patches while preserving opt-out for scratch docs.\\\"}; log_type=progress\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-02 06:04:57 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"emoji\": \"\\u26a0\\ufe0f\", \"message\": \"Tool verification: manage_docs create_doc register_existing required content; retry with content succeeded but created new file audit_replace_section.md under docs_dir (potential duplicate of AUDIT_MANAGE_DOCS_REPLACE_SECTION.md). reasoning:{\\\"why\\\":\\\"Need to record registry behavior and potential duplication risk during tool verification.\\\",\\\"what\\\":\\\"Constraints: use MCP tools; no manual edits; note infra primacy concerns.\\\",\\\"how\\\":\\\"Attempted create_doc with register_existing (missing content error), retried with content payload; manage_docs created audit_replace_section.md and registered doc key.\\\"}\", \"meta\": {\"action\": \"manage_docs_create_doc\", \"component\": \"tool_verification\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"manage_docs created audit_replace_section.md and registered doc key.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: use MCP tools\": \"\", \"no manual edits\": \"\", \"note infra primacy concerns.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Need to record registry behavior and potential duplication risk during tool verification.\\\"}\": \"\", \"reasoning\": \"{\\\"how\\\": \\\"Attempted create_doc with register_existing (missing content error), retrie