{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 05:36:22 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunks\": [{\"byte_end\": 23002, \"byte_start\": 0, \"chunk_index\": 0, \"content\": \"\\n# \\ud83d\\udccb Documentation Update Log \\u2014 scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\n**Maintained By:** Scribe\\n**Timezone:** UTC\\n\\n> Track every structured documentation change. Use `log_type=\\\"doc_updates\\\"` (or `--log doc_updates`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n\\n\\n## Entry Format\\n```\\n[EMOJI] [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS UTC] [Agent: <name>] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Message text   doc=<doc_name>; section=<section_id>; action=<action_type>; [additional metadata]\\n```\\n\\n**Required Metadata Fields:**\\n- `doc`: Document name (e.g., \\\"architecture\\\", \\\"phase_plan\\\", \\\"checklist\\\")\\n- `section`: Section ID being modified (e.g., \\\"directory_structure\\\", \\\"phase_overview\\\")\\n- `action`: Action type (`replace_section`, `append`, `status_update`, etc.)\\n\\n**Optional Metadata Fields:**\\n- `file_path`: Full path to the Markdown file\\n- `changes_count`: Number of lines changed\\n- `review_status`: pending/approved/rejected\\n- `reviewer`: Reviewer name\\n- `jira_ticket`: Associated ticket number\\n- `confidence`: Confidence level for the change (0-1)\\n- `context`: Additional context about the change\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Tips for Documentation Updates\\n- Always specify which document section you're updating via `section=`.\\n- Include `action=` to indicate the type of modification.\\n- Reference checklist items or phases when applicable.\\n- Use `--dry-run` first when making structural changes.\\n- All documentation changes are automatically tracked and versioned.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Entries will populate below\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:17:54 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [audit_report] full via create_doc   action=create_doc; doc=audit_report; doc_name=AUDIT_REPORT; register_doc=True; section=; sha_after=a5a9078f4de15356dfed0dff158e39a4779b64494c5151255a1206da9a42ea78; log_type=doc_updates\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:18:15 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [architecture] problem_statement via replace_section   action=replace_section; doc=architecture; section=problem_statement; sha_after=c6c013c2ea6189ff982e5867bf29cd3407e71d776c544c0c20cfc500272646a1; log_type=doc_updates\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:18:20 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [architecture] requirements_constraints via replace_section   action=replace_section; doc=architecture; section=requirements_constraints; sha_after=18250b0dc1200e467106e123e58c071509c80c55bc8a2aa89c4cfe89eb55c85a; log_type=doc_updates\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:18:23 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [architecture] architecture_overview via replace_section   action=replace_section; doc=architecture; section=architecture_overview; sha_after=5c67dfff3e1077f8f50da0ecad31577a731de7681cdbe8d9e15b11a640ce75e3; log_type=doc_updates\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:18:35 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [architecture] detailed_design via replace_section   action=replace_section; doc=architecture; section=detailed_design; sha_after=887ef5ca4078da62b306a408ddd975e1f71d38aef6da450ce6edfdba8075ccaf; log_type=doc_updates\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:18:38 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [architecture] directory_structure via replace_section   action=replace_section; doc=architecture; section=directory_structure; sha_after=fd6f1d00e5684a637ee08aa144daeda0b3bd81ca65b5fafc7ed5c0af697456e7; log_type=doc_updates\\n[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-02 04:18:40 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Doc update [architec