{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 05:47:55 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunk\": {\"byte_end\": 3700, \"byte_start\": 2745, \"content\": \"- **Non-Functional Requirements:**\\n  - Concurrency-safe append semantics for JSON logs; MD remains single-line under lock.\\n  - Deterministic path validation (hard-fail on scope mismatch).\\n  - Backwards-compatible project-mode behavior.\\n- **Assumptions:**\\n  - Repo root is set via `set_project` with absolute path.\\n  - MCP runtime may provide a per-session identifier; if absent, router generates and persists per connection.\\n- **Risks & Mitigations:**\\n  - **Risk:** No session id \\u2192 router generates/persists per connection; enforce validation. [Audit B]\\n  - **Risk:** Concurrent append corruption \\u2192 append-only JSONL + file locks; bounded retry. [Audit C]\\n  - **Risk:** Mode confusion \\u2192 router tool gating with clear hard-fail errors. [Audit A,C]\\n<!-- ID: architecture_overview -->\\n- **Solution Summary:** Introduce ExecutionContext, session-scoped state, and sentinel logging to make multi-agent work safe and auditable.\\n- **Component Breakdown:**\\n\", \"line_end\": 65, \"line_start\": 52}, \"frontmatter\": {\"category\": \"engineering\", \"created_by\": \"Corta Labs\", \"doc_type\": \"architecture\", \"id\": \"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1-architecture\", \"last_updated\": \"2026-01-03\", \"maintained_by\": \"Corta Labs\", \"owners\": [], \"related_docs\": [], \"status\": \"draft\", \"summary\": \"\", \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"\\ud83c\\udfd7\\ufe0f Architecture Guide \\u2014 scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"version\": \"0.1\"}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 338, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 15, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"---\\nid: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1-architecture\\ntitle: \\\"\\\\U0001F3D7\\\\uFE0F Architecture Guide \\\\u2014 scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\\"\\ndoc_type: architecture\\ncategory: engineering\\nstatus: draft\\nversion: '0.1'\\nlast_updated: '2026-01-03'\\nmaintained_by: Corta Labs\\ncreated_by: Corta Labs\\nowners: []\\nrelated_docs: []\\ntags: []\\nsummary: ''\\n---\\n\", \"has_frontmatter\": true, \"mode\": \"line_range\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\", \"byte_size\": 10076, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 1, \"line_count\": 157, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \".scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\", \"sha256\": \"a16cc78a5ae778863faa713870de9d0b3b67c6ba72e2cbb9170528e04f8c5d58\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T05:47:55.752271Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T05:47:55.769222+00:00_5ac33ab4", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T05:47:55.769261+00:00"}
