{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 05:49:32 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunk\": {\"byte_end\": 4114, \"byte_start\": 2868, \"content\": \"  - Deterministic path validation (hard-fail on scope mismatch).\\n  - Backwards-compatible project-mode behavior.\\n- **Assumptions:**\\n  - MCP runtime must provide a per-session transport_session_id (or explicit session_id); router hard-fails if missing.\\n  - **Risk:** Missing session id \\u2192 hard-fail at router; clients must supply transport_session_id or session_id. [Audit B]\\n  - **Risk:** No session id \\u2192 router generates/persists per connection; enforce validation. [Audit B]\\n  - **Risk:** Concurrent append corruption \\u2192 append-only JSONL + file locks; bounded retry. [Audit C]\\n  - **Risk:** Mode confusion \\u2192 router tool gating with clear hard-fail errors. [Audit A,C]\\n<!-- ID: architecture_overview -->\\n- **Solution Summary:** Introduce ExecutionContext, session-scoped state, and sentinel logging to make multi-agent work safe and auditable.\\n- **Component Breakdown:**\\n  - **ExecutionContext Validator:** Validates required fields and enforces mode constraints.\\n  - **Session Context Store:** Keeps per-session project/sentinel context (no global leakage).\\n  - **Mode Router:** Exposes only the toolset for the active mode; hard-fails on mismatches.\\n  - **Sentinel Logger:** Writes daily MD + JSONL logs; supports bug/security schemas.\\n\", \"line_end\": 68, \"line_start\": 54}, \"frontmatter\": {\"category\": \"engineering\", \"created_by\": \"Corta Labs\", \"doc_type\": \"architecture\", \"id\": \"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1-architecture\", \"last_updated\": \"2026-01-03\", \"maintained_by\": \"Corta Labs\", \"owners\": [], \"related_docs\": [], \"status\": \"draft\", \"summary\": \"\", \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"\\ud83c\\udfd7\\ufe0f Architecture Guide \\u2014 scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"version\": \"0.1\"}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 338, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 15, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"---\\nid: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1-architecture\\ntitle: \\\"\\\\U0001F3D7\\\\uFE0F Architecture Guide \\\\u2014 scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\\"\\ndoc_type: architecture\\ncategory: engineering\\nstatus: draft\\nversion: '0.1'\\nlast_updated: '2026-01-03'\\nmaintained_by: Corta Labs\\ncreated_by: Corta Labs\\nowners: []\\nrelated_docs: []\\ntags: []\\nsummary: ''\\n---\\n\", \"has_frontmatter\": true, \"mode\": \"line_range\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\", \"byte_size\": 10214, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 1, \"line_count\": 156, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \".scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\", \"sha256\": \"e763c3eb1887ba4fd12b118e1307896c7680c2ff034a57ad8e4d8fc8d2ee23eb\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T05:49:32.576241Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T05:49:32.593036+00:00_b4c536fc", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T05:49:32.593075+00:00"}
