16f3379cb5a8a94b85d9ed\\\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T05:28:28.423316Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 05:28:29 UTC\"}], \"ok\": true, \"pagination\": {\"has_next\": true, \"has_prev\": false, \"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_count\": 54}, \"recent_projects\": [\"scribe_mcp\"], \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_mcp\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"token_warning\": {\"estimated_tokens\": 55537, \"suggestion\": \"Use compact=True for ~70% token reduction\", \"threshold\": 4000}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T05:56:48.775936Z; tool=read_recent; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T05:56:48.795619+00:00_be7d1895", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T05:56:48.796730+00:00"}
