efore session context was bound: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"No session-scoped project configured\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"; set_project re-run with transport_session_id to bind context before further inspection.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"meta\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"content_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"log\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"log_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"progress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"medium\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"reasoning\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Re-ran set_project with transport_session_id=codex-session-verify, then proceeded to re-attempt read_file.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: must log tool failures; need to set_project with same session id before further tool calls; keep context consistent.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Step 2 blocks project-mode global fallback, so read_file requires a session-scoped project; initial attempt lacked that binding.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"medium\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"raw_line\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"[\\\\\\\\u26a0\\\\\\\\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 06:03:50 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] read_file failed before session context was bound: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"No session-scoped project configured\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"; set_project re-run with transport_session_id to bind context before further inspection.   reasoning={\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Re-ran set_project with transport_session_id=codex-session-verify, then proceeded to re-attempt read_file.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: must log tool failures; need to set_project with same session id before further tool calls; keep context consistent.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Step 2 blocks project-mode global fallback, so read_file requires a session-scoped project; initial attempt lacked that binding.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}; prior