urrent_project when agent session succeeds, and prevented manage_docs registry updates from mutating global current_project; added state manager test for session-only updates.   reasoning={\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Updated state/manager.py to support mirror_global, set tools/set_project.py to disable global mirroring when agent context succeeds, set tools/manage_docs.py registry updates to mirror_global=False, and added tests/test_utils.py coverage for session-only updates.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: keep legacy fallback for non-session flows; avoid touching unrelated callers; add minimal test coverage.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Step 3 requires removing global current_project mirroring so concurrent sessions don't overwrite each other while preserving legacy behavior when no session context exists.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ts\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-01-03 05:59:08 UTC\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"agent\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Scribe\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": null, \\\\\\\"confidence\\\\\\\": 1.0, \\\\\\\"emoji\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\u2139\\\\\\\\ufe0f\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"1dbc4169a1aa4b1b60fc703a1a45e5a2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Tool call: read_file\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"meta\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"content_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"log\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"format_requested\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"readable\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"log_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tool_logs\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"medium\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"response_data\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"chunks\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"byte_end\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 3369, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"byte_start\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 0, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"chunk_index\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 0, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\