 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: keep session identity requirement for concurrency; avoid reintroducing global project fallback; only relax read_file project requirement.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"User requested auto-supplied context and global read_file access without set_project; current enforcement blocked read_file and forced manual context in calls.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"medium\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"raw_line\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2705] [2026-01-03 06:07:53 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Adjusted read_file to allow usage without a session-scoped project and added server-side transport_session_id fallback from MCP kwargs (session_id/client_id/connection_id) to auto-supply context when available; still hard-fails if no transport/session id.   reasoning={\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Set resolve_logging_context(require_project=False) in read_file logging and added kwargs-based transport_session_id fallback in server call_tool before enforcing session identity.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: keep session identity requirement for concurrency; avoid reintroducing global project fallback; only relax read_file project requirement.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"User requested auto-supplied context and global read_file access without set_project; current enforcement blocked read_file and forced manual context in calls.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"2026-01-03 06:07:53 UTC\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"agent\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": null, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"confidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 1.0, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"emoji\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2705\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"fee87dc4490d5c79426f70b5b56d1b6d\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Aligned set_project session_projects mapping with router ExecutionContext by using context.session_id (when available) for state_manager.set_current_project; preserves agent_manager session id for DB while unblocking session-scoped project resolution.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"meta\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"content_type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"log\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"log_type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"progress\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"medium\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reasoning\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Captured ExecutionContext in set_project and passed context.session_id to state_manager.set_current_project (fallback to agent session id if absent).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: keep agent_manager session id for DB/audit; avoid breaking legacy fallback; use ExecutionContext when present.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Read_file/logging now resolve session projects by exec_context.session_id; using only agent_manager session id left session_projects empty for tool calls tied to transport_session_id.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\