er tool call.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Commandment #0 requires checking progress log before new work; proceeding with Step 3 global-state removal.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"low\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"raw_line\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"[\\\\\\\\u2139\\\\\\\\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 05:56:52 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Read recent sentinel progress entries before starting Step 3 concurrency fixes.   reasoning={\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Called read_recent(project=scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1, limit=5).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Constraints: use read_recent/query_entries for log viewing; avoid full log reads; log after tool call.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Commandment #0 requires checking progress log before new work; proceeding with Step 3 global-state removal.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ts\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-01-03 05:56:52 UTC\\\\\\\"}], \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"pagination\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"has_next\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"has_prev\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"page\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"page_size\\\\\\\": 10, \\\\\\\"total_count\\\\\\\": 184}, \\\\\\\"recent_projects\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"scribe_mcp\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"scribe_tool_output_refinement\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"reminders\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"context\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Entries:    Last: \\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"emoji\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\ud83c\\\\\\\\udfaf\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"level\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"score\\\\\\\": 3, \\\\\\\"tone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"neutral\\\\\\\"}], \\\\\\\"token_warning\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens\\\\\\\": 11652, \\\\\\\"suggestion\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Use compact=True for ~70% token reduction\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"threshold\\\\\\\": 4000}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T06:11:29.724732Z; tool=read_recent; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-01-03 06:11:29 UTC\\\"}, {\\\"agent\\\": \\\"Codex\\\", \\\"category\\\": null, \\\"confidence\\\": 1.0, \\\"emoji\\\": \\\"\\\\u2705\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"ed9e3efec3d657af9bd456b55401f17f\\\", \\\"message\\\": \\\"Adjusted read_file to allow usage without a session-scoped project and added server-side transport_session_id fallback from MCP kwargs (session_id/client_id/connection_id) to auto-supply context when available; still hard-fails if no transport/session id.\\\", \\\"meta\\\": {\\\"content_type\\\": \\\"log\\\", \\\"log_type\\\": \\\"progress\\\", \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Set resolve_logging_context(require_project=False) in read_file logging and added kwargs-based transport_session_id fallback in server call_tool before enforcing session identity.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Constraints: keep session identity requirement for concurrency; avoid reintroducing global project fallback; only relax read_file project requirement.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"User requested auto-supplied context and global read_file access without set_project; current enforcement blocked read_file and forced manual context in calls.\\\\\\\"}\\\"}, \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"raw_line\\\": \\\"[\\\\u2705] [2026-01-03 06:07:53 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Adjusted read_file to allow usage without a session-scoped project and added server-side transport_session_id fallback from MCP kwargs (session_id/client_id/connection_id) to auto-supply context when available; still hard-fails if no transport/session id.   reasoning={\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Set resolve_logging_context(require_project=False) in read_file logging and added kwargs-based transport_session_id fallback in server call_tool before enforcing session identity.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Constraints: keep session identity requirement for concurrency; avoid reintroducing global project fallback; only relax read_file project requirement.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"User requested auto-supplied context and global read_file access without set_project; current enforcement blocked read_file and forced manual context in calls.\\\\\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-01-03 06:07:53 UTC\\\"}, {\\\"agent\\\": \\\"Codex\\\", \\\"category\\\": null, \\\"confidence\\\": 1.0, \\\"emoji\\\": \\\"\\\\u2705\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"fee87dc4490d5c79426f70b5b56d1b6d\\\", \\\"message\\\": \\\"Aligned set_project session_projects mapping with router ExecutionContext by using context.session_id (when available) for state_manager.set_current_project; preserves agent_manager session id for DB while unblocking session-scoped project resolution.\\\", \\\"meta\\\": {\\\"content_type\\\": \\\"log\\\", \\\"log_type\\\": \\\"progress\\\", \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Captured ExecutionContext in set_project and passed context.session_id to state_manager.set_current_project (fallback to agent session id if absent).\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Constraints: keep agent_manager session id for DB/audit; avoid breaking legacy fallback; use ExecutionContext when present.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Read_file/logging now resolve session projects by exec_context.session_id; using only agent_manager session id left session_projects empty for tool calls tied to transport_session_id.\\\\\\\"}\\\"}, \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"raw_line\\\": \\\"[\\\\u2705] [2026-01-03 06:04:34 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Aligned set_project session_projects mapping with router ExecutionContext by using context.session_id (when available) for state_manager.set_current_project; preserves agent_manager session id for DB while unblocking session-scoped project resolution.   reasoning={\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Captured ExecutionContext in set_project and passed context.session_id to state_manager.set_current_project (fallback to agent session id if absent).\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Constraints: keep agent_manager session id for DB/audit; avoid breaking legacy fallback; use ExecutionContext when present.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Read_file/logging now resolve session projects by exec_context.session_id; using only agent_manager session id left session_projects empty for tool calls tied to transport_session_id.\\\\\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-01-03 06:04:34 UTC\\\"}, {\\\"agent\\\": \\\"Codex\\\", \\\"category\\\": null, \\\"confidence\\\": 1.0, \\\"emoji\\\": \\\"\\\\u26a0\\\\ufe0f\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"58b4fa2f0b4adc41f05710a56b373042\\\", \\\"message\\\": \\\"read_file failed before session context was bound: \\\\\\\"No session-scoped project configured\\\\\\\"; set_project re-run with transport_session_id to bind context before further inspection.\\\", \\\"meta\\\": {\\\"content_type\\\": \\\"log\\\", \\\"log_type\\\": \\\"progress\\\", \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Re-ran set_project with transport_session_id=codex-session-verify, then proceeded to re-attempt read_file.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Constraints: must log tool failures; need to set_project with same session id before further tool calls; keep context consistent.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Step 2 blocks project-mode global fallback, so read_file requires a session-scoped project; initial attempt lacked that binding.\\\\\\\"}\\\"}, \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"raw_line\\\": \\\"[\\\\u26a0\\\\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 06:03:50 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] read_file failed before session context was bound: \\\\\\\"No session-scoped project configured\\\\\\\"; set_project re-run with transport_session_id to bind context before further inspection.   reasoning={\\\\\\\"how\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Re-ran set_project with transport_session_id=codex-session-verify, then proceeded to re-attempt read_file.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Constraints: must log tool failures; need to set_project with same session id before further tool calls; keep context consistent.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"why\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Step 2 blocks project-mode global fallback, so read_file requires a session-scoped project; initial attempt lacked that binding.\\\\\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-01-03 06:03:50 UTC\\\"}], \\\"ok\\\": true, \\\"pagination\\\": {\\\"has_next\\\": true, \\\"has_prev\\\": false, \\\"page\\\": 1, \\\"page_size\\\": 15, \\\"total_count\\\": 196}, \\\"recent_projects\\\": [\\\"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\\", \\\"scribe_mcp\\\", \\\"scribe_tool_output_refinement\\\"], \\\"reminders\\\": [{\\\"category\\\": \\\"context\\\", \\\"context\\\": \\\"Entries:    Last: \\\", \\\"emoji\\\": \\\"\\\\ud83c\\\\udfaf\\\", \\\"level\\\": \\\"info\\\", \\\"message\\\": \\\"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\\\", \\\"score\\\": 3, \\\"tone\\\": \\\"neutral\\\"}], \\\"token_warning\\\": {\\\"estimated_tokens\\\": 470250, \\\"suggestion\\\": \\\"Use compact=True for ~70% token reduction\\\", \\\"threshold\\\": 4000}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T06:32:48.905039Z; tool=read_recent; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 06:32:48 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 1.0, \"emoji\": \"\\u2139\\ufe0f\", \"id\": \"ec9af0d6a666af3c40231a50229e21f0\", \"message\": \"Acknowledged shift to default sentinel mode to avoid rejecting logs and keep isolated audits clean; will adjust ExecutionContext default mode and routing rules so tools without set_project route to sentinel logs (global daily).\", \"meta\": {\"content_type\": \"log\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"phase\": \"planning\", \"priority\": \"low\", \"reasoning\": \"{\\\"how\\\": \\\"Plan to set default mode to sentinel when no explicit project context is provided, update tool routing to log to sentinel for missing session project, and keep project tools requiring explicit set_project.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: sentinel logs are global daily; project audits must stay isolated; no silent project auto-select; tools must still enforce sentinel-only restrictions.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"User clarified default should be sentinel mode so missing project context logs still land in global sentinel logs and avoid audit pollution.\\\"}\"}, \"priority\": \"low\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2139\\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 06:32:02 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Acknowledged shift to default sentinel mode to avoid rejecting logs and keep isolated audits clean; will adjust ExecutionContext default mode and routing rules so tools without set_project route to sentinel logs (global daily).   phase=planning; reasoning={\\\"how\\\": \\\"Plan to set default mode to sentinel when no explicit project context is provided, update tool routing to log to sentinel for missing session project, and keep project tools requiring explicit set_project.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: sentinel logs are global daily; project audits must stay isolated; no silent project auto-select; tools must still enforce sentinel-only restrictions.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"User clarified default should be sentinel mode so missing project context logs still land in global sentinel logs and avoid audit pollution.\\\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 06:32:02 UTC\"}], \"ok\": true, \"pagination\": {\"has_next\": true, \"has_prev\": false, \"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 5, \"total_count\": 200}, \"recent_projects\": [\"scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"scribe_mcp\", \"scribe_tool_output_refinement\"], \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"token_warning\": {\"estimated_tokens\": 1302958, \"suggestion\": \"Use compact=True for ~70% token reduction\", \"threshold\": 4000}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T06:48:00.419815Z; tool=read_recent; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T06:48:00.479877+00:00_dcbcf85d", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T06:48:00.528208+00:00"}
