{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 06:56:21 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Tool call: read_recent | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"count\": 10, \"entries\": [{\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 1.0, \"emoji\": \"\\ud83e\\udded\", \"id\": \"41085bde6ccc9724ccfbc39636478aaf\", \"message\": \"Planned DB-backed concurrency upgrade: audit persistence touchpoints, add SQLite session registry + session mode/project tables, migrate reminder cooldown cache to SQLite, and add multi-process tests with JSON-state fallback.\", \"meta\": {\"content_type\": \"log\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"phase\": \"planning\", \"priority\": \"medium\", \"reasoning\": \"{\\\"how\\\": \\\"Outlined phased steps: audit boundaries, add DB tables and wiring, migrate reminder cache, and add tests for cross-process concurrency.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: preserve current behavior via fallback, keep sentinel/project isolation, ensure multi-process safety.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"User asked for a concrete plan to address multi-process concurrency limitations (shared JSON state, file-based reminder cache, no session registry).\\\"}\"}, \"priority\": \"medium\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\ud83e\\udded] [2026-01-03 06:56:08 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Planned DB-backed concurrency upgrade: audit persistence touchpoints, add SQLite session registry + session mode/project tables, migrate reminder cooldown cache to SQLite, and add multi-process tests with JSON-state fallback.   phase=planning; reasoning={\\\"how\\\": \\\"Outlined phased steps: audit boundaries, add DB tables and wiring, migrate reminder cache, and add tests for cross-process concurrency.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: preserve current behavior via fallback, keep sentinel/project isolation, ensure multi-process safety.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"User asked for a concrete plan to address multi-process concurrency limitations (shared JSON state, file-based reminder cache, no session registry).\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 06:56:08 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 1.0, \"emoji\": \"\\u2705\", \"id\": \"a1d8ba23be9f733d215cf0ef9b1a6630\", \"message\": \"Project-mode append_event test: should route to append_entry and write to progress log.\", \"meta\": {\"content_type\": \"log\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"phase\": \"verification\", \"priority\": \"medium\"}, \"priority\": \"medium\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2705] [2026-01-03 06:54:27 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Project-mode append_event test: should route to append_entry and write to progress log.   phase=verification; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 06:54:27 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Codex\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 1.0, \"emoji\": \"\\u2705\", \"id\": \"97df32b9255aeb6ebef08663f3f408df\", \"message\": \"Updated sentinel/project routing: append_entry now falls back to sentinel when no project, append_event can route to append_entry in project mode, added session recent_projects in sentinel context, and agent_id auto-fill for reminder cache scoping.\", \"meta\": {\"content_type\": \"log\", \"files\": \"[\\\"server.py\\\", \\\"shared/logging_utils.py\\\", \\\"tools/append_entry.py\\\", \\\"tools/sentinel_tools.py\\\"]\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"phase\": \"implementation\", \"priority\": \"medium\", \"reasoning\": \"{\\\"how\\\": \\\"Allowed append_entry in sentinel and append_event in project mode; resolve_logging_context now fills agent_id and recent_projects in sentinel; append_entry handles sentinel mode directly or falls back to sentinel on project resolution failure; append_event routes to append_entry in project mode.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: no implicit project selection; sentinel default; tools must not silently write project logs from sentinel; preserve strict mode gating while allowing fallbacks.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"User requested sentinel-mode recent_projects, improved reminder cache scoping by agent, and automatic append_event/append_entry fallback to avoid duplicate calls.\\\"}\"}, \"priority\": \"medium\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2705] [2026-01-03 06:53:29 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Updated sentinel/project routing: append_entry now falls back to sentinel when no project, append_event can route to append_entry in project mode, added session recent_projects in sentinel context, and agent_id auto-fill for reminder cache scoping.   files=[\\\"server.py\\\", \\\"shared/logging_utils.py\\\", \\\"tools/append_entry.py\\\", \\\"tools/sentinel_tools.py\\\"]; phase=implementation; reasoning={\\\"how\\\": \\\"Allowed append_entry in sentinel and append_event in project mode; resolve_logging_context now fills agent_id and recent_projects in sentinel; append_entry handles sentinel mode directly or falls back to sentinel on project resolution failure; append_event routes to append_entry in project mode.\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Constraints: no implicit project selection; sentinel default; tools must not silently write project logs from sentinel; preserve strict mode gating while allowing fallbacks.\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"User requested sentinel-mode recent_projects, improved reminder cache scoping by agent, and automatic append_event/append_entry fallback to avoid duplicate calls.\\\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 06:53:29 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Scribe\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 1.0, \"emoji\": \"\\u2139\\ufe0f\", \"id\": \"100e24f3674c2f38aa4c75b49a635fee\", \"message\": \"Tool call: read_file\", \"meta\": {\"content_type\": \"log\", \"format_requested\": \"readable\", \"log_type\": \"tool_logs\", \"priority\": \"medium\", \"response_data\": \"{\\\"chunks\\\": [{\\\"byte_end\\\": 6420, \\\"byte_start\\\": 0, \\\"chunk