{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 06:56:54 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"matches\": [{\"context\": [\"    def get_last_known_project(\\n\"], \"context_end\": 387, \"context_start\": 387, \"line\": \"    def get_last_known_project(\\n\", \"line_number\": 387}], \"max_matches\": 200, \"mode\": \"search\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/shared/project_registry.py\", \"byte_size\": 23401, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 4, \"line_count\": 648, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"shared/project_registry.py\", \"sha256\": \"4a2a0bfe8f6d1d5a05398e4f9543750e74453a8d091ffa35fb02d2d71ab416fd\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T06:56:54.959638Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T06:56:54.974268+00:00_81b58cc5", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T06:56:54.974301+00:00"}
