{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 06:57:44 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"scan_only\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/storage/base.py\", \"byte_size\": 8891, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 2, \"line_count\": 286, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"storage/base.py\", \"sha256\": \"c0a8a7729a64e28443dba462fd8686037ac0779a7976401b3cd2921252558855\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T06:57:44.052141Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_sentinel_concurrency_v1/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T06:57:44.066846+00:00_cf635538", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T06:57:44.066873+00:00"}
